  "name": "theme",
  "title": "Theme",
  "description": "The shadcn tokens every Tailwind item is styled with (neutral base, light and dark) and their Tailwind v4 `@theme inline` bindings. The CLI adds only the tokens the host does not define yet. The examples compile the same values (lab/studio/tailwind.mjs).",
  "cssVars": {
